{
  "about": "K4 G2 最终批：lite 真窗口，树上移动／排序／非法循环／拖进接收层级／拖到只收别处条目的条目上不接（T9），公共悬停卡新建／换模板／归属与主归属；新条目固定打开、标题选中后替换；铺满左栏里的看板坐标写入；旧版隔离。；v3 切换后保留全部 canonical 验收步骤，旧产品回切尾段已退役。",
  "steps": [
    {
      "seed": "lite"
    },
    {
      "call": "book.list",
      "input": {},
      "save": "books"
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.list",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}"
      },
      "save": "roots"
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.list",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "all": true
      },
      "save": "entries"
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.create",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "parent": "${roots.0.id}",
        "template": "tpl-group",
        "title": "Synthetic tree A"
      },
      "save": "a"
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.create",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "parent": "${roots.0.id}",
        "template": "tpl-group",
        "title": "Synthetic tree B"
      },
      "save": "b"
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.move",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "id": "${a.id}",
        "parent": "${roots.0.id}",
        "index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.move",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "id": "${b.id}",
        "parent": "${roots.0.id}",
        "index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.create",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "parent": "${a.id}",
        "template": "tpl-chapter",
        "title": "Synthetic moved entry"
      },
      "save": "moved"
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.create",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "parent": "${a.id}",
        "template": "tpl-group",
        "title": "Synthetic nested"
      },
      "save": "nested"
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.create",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "parent": "${b.id}",
        "template": "tpl-group",
        "title": "Synthetic member host"
      },
      "save": "host"
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.update",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "id": "${host.id}",
        "overrides": {
          "accept": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.create",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "parent": "${b.id}",
        "template": "tpl-chapter",
        "title": "Synthetic sibling"
      },
      "save": "sibling"
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.get",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "id": "019a3f62-5400-73cf-9bf7-887287abd661"
      },
      "save": "boardA",
      "expect": {
        "/title": "构想组1",
        "/template": "tpl-idea-group",
        "/parent": "${roots.1.id}"
      },
      "note": "layout.put takes positions keyed by entry id, and the scenario language does not expand references in object keys; since 2026-11-15 a position needs a live entry. So the board uses the lite seed's two 构想 groups, whose ids the seed fixes; this step fails first if the seed changes."
    },
    {
      "call": "layout.put",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "scope": "${roots.1.id}",
        "mode": "board",
        "positions": {
          "019a3f62-5400-73cf-9bf7-887287abd661": [
            16.0,
            140.0
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "layout.put",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "scope": "${roots.1.id}",
        "mode": "grid",
        "positions": {
          "019a3f62-5400-73cf-9bf7-887287abd661": [
            2.0,
            3.0
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "layout.put",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "scope": "root",
        "mode": "relation_graph",
        "positions": {
          "019a3f62-5400-73cf-9bf7-887287abd661": [
            7.0,
            8.0
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.get",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "id": "019a3f62-57e8-79e7-b63f-bdcc1afbd49a"
      },
      "save": "boardB",
      "expect": {
        "/title": "构想组2",
        "/template": "tpl-idea-group",
        "/parent": "${roots.1.id}"
      },
      "note": "layout.put takes positions keyed by entry id, and the scenario language does not expand references in object keys; since 2026-11-15 a position needs a live entry. So the board uses the lite seed's two 构想 groups, whose ids the seed fixes; this step fails first if the seed changes."
    },
    {
      "call": "layout.put",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "scope": "${roots.1.id}",
        "mode": "board",
        "positions": {
          "019a3f62-57e8-79e7-b63f-bdcc1afbd49a": [
            56.0,
            220.0
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "layout.put",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "scope": "${roots.1.id}",
        "mode": "grid",
        "positions": {
          "019a3f62-57e8-79e7-b63f-bdcc1afbd49a": [
            2.0,
            3.0
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "layout.put",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "scope": "root",
        "mode": "relation_graph",
        "positions": {
          "019a3f62-57e8-79e7-b63f-bdcc1afbd49a": [
            7.0,
            8.0
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "launch": {
        "env": {
          "DRIFTING_APPEARANCE": "light"
        },
        "settings": {
          "device": {
            "modules": {
              "first_run.done": true,
              "guides.seen": [
                "workspace-tour"
              ]
            }
          },
          "account": {
            "language.ui_locale": "en"
          }
        }
      },
      "note": "The workspace tour comes up once on a device that has not seen it, 0.7 s after a book's workspace shows, its first bubble over the left column's Tab row and the rows under it (m24-sea.md 「导览」, kernel-v5 §15 item 50; on books of the current format since UP, 2026-11-17). This profile is fresh, so the device is told it has seen the tour, as the other window scenarios do; without it the tree drags below land on the bubble."
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "timeout_ms": 30000
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "window.focus"
    },
    {
      "app": "book.open",
      "params": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "state": {
          "/book/version": 5
        },
        "timeout_ms": 15000
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "action.dispatch",
      "params": {
        "name": "workspace::ToggleLeftSidebar"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "state": {
          "/left/open": true,
          "/v3Sidebar/registered": true
        },
        "timeout_ms": 15000
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "label": "${roots.0.title}",
        "role": "RadioButton"
      },
      "note": "A project opens on 「全部」 (kernel-v5 §5, T1); the manuscript's tree is the 书稿 Tab."
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "state": {
          "/v3Sidebar/entry": "${roots.0.id}"
        },
        "timeout_ms": 15000
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "until": "time",
        "ms": 600
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "input.move",
      "params": {
        "x": 800,
        "y": 120
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "until": "time",
        "ms": 600
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "label": "Synthetic moved entry",
        "role": "Group",
        "count": 1
      },
      "save": "residenceFrom"
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "label": "Synthetic tree B",
        "role": "Group",
        "count": 1
      },
      "save": "residenceTo"
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "label": "Skip tour",
        "absent": true
      },
      "note": "No tour bubble lies over the tree (see the launch step): the drags below go to the rows."
    },
    {
      "app": "input.drag",
      "params": {
        "from": "${residenceFrom.nodes.0.center}",
        "to": "${residenceTo.nodes.0.center}",
        "steps": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "until": "time",
        "ms": 4000
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait"
    },
    {
      "app": "state.get",
      "expect": {
        "/v3/levels/${b.id}/children": [
          "${host.id}",
          "${sibling.id}",
          "${moved.id}"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.get",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "id": "${moved.id}"
      },
      "expect": {
        "/parent": "${b.id}"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "input.move",
      "params": {
        "x": 800,
        "y": 120
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "until": "time",
        "ms": 600
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "label": "Synthetic sibling",
        "role": "Group",
        "count": 1
      },
      "save": "orderFrom"
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "label": "Synthetic moved entry",
        "role": "Group",
        "count": 1
      },
      "save": "orderTo"
    },
    {
      "app": "input.drag",
      "params": {
        "from": "${orderFrom.nodes.0.center}",
        "to": "${orderTo.nodes.0.center}",
        "steps": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "until": "time",
        "ms": 4000
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait"
    },
    {
      "app": "state.get",
      "expect": {
        "/v3/levels/${b.id}/children": [
          "${host.id}",
          "${moved.id}",
          "${sibling.id}"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "input.move",
      "params": {
        "x": 800,
        "y": 120
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "until": "time",
        "ms": 600
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "label": "Synthetic tree A",
        "role": "Group",
        "count": 1
      },
      "save": "cycleFrom"
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "label": "Synthetic nested",
        "role": "Group",
        "count": 1
      },
      "save": "cycleTo"
    },
    {
      "app": "input.drag",
      "params": {
        "from": "${cycleFrom.nodes.0.center}",
        "to": "${cycleTo.nodes.0.center}",
        "steps": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "until": "time",
        "ms": 600
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.get",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "id": "${a.id}"
      },
      "expect": {
        "/parent": "${roots.0.id}"
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.update",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "id": "${sibling.id}",
        "overrides": {
          "accept": true
        }
      },
      "note": "T9 (kernel-v5 §16 「挂名」, §17 「底栏视图铺满」; the v5 task book's item 52, docs/rust-rewrite/handoff/v5-tracks.md at 64563601b): in the left column a drag only moves house, and an entry that only takes entries from elsewhere takes no drop. The sibling chapter is turned into such an entry for this check."
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "until": "time",
        "ms": 4000
      },
      "note": "The wait the scenarios give a write to reach the window: ui.wait reads its state pointers as written, and a reference in an object key is not filled in (scenario.rs fills strings and expectation pointers), so this pointer, which names an entry by reference, is checked by state.get's expect below."
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait"
    },
    {
      "app": "state.get",
      "expect": {
        "/v3/levels/${sibling.id}/settings/accept": true
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "input.move",
      "params": {
        "x": 800,
        "y": 120
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "until": "time",
        "ms": 600
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "label": "Synthetic moved entry",
        "role": "Group",
        "count": 1
      },
      "save": "refuseFrom"
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "label": "Synthetic sibling",
        "role": "Group",
        "count": 1
      },
      "save": "refuseTo"
    },
    {
      "app": "input.drag",
      "params": {
        "from": "${refuseFrom.nodes.0.center}",
        "to": "${refuseTo.nodes.0.center}",
        "steps": 12
      },
      "note": "Let go over the middle of the accept-only row: refused (T9). Before T9 this drop attached the entry there (membership.add)."
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "until": "time",
        "ms": 4000
      },
      "note": "The same wait the drops that write get, so a write this refused drop must not make would have landed by now."
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait"
    },
    {
      "app": "state.get",
      "expect": {
        "/v3/levels/${b.id}/children": [
          "${host.id}",
          "${moved.id}",
          "${sibling.id}"
        ],
        "/v3/levels/${sibling.id}/members": [],
        "/v3/memberships/[member=${moved.id}]": null
      },
      "note": "Nothing moved house and nothing was attached anywhere (T9)."
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.get",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "id": "${moved.id}"
      },
      "expect": {
        "/parent": "${b.id}"
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.update",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "id": "${sibling.id}",
        "overrides": {
          "accept": false
        }
      },
      "note": "The sibling is a plain chapter again for the steps below."
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "until": "time",
        "ms": 4000
      },
      "note": "The wait the scenarios give a write to reach the window: ui.wait reads its state pointers as written, and a reference in an object key is not filled in (scenario.rs fills strings and expectation pointers), so this pointer, which names an entry by reference, is checked by state.get's expect below."
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait"
    },
    {
      "app": "state.get",
      "expect": {
        "/v3/levels/${sibling.id}": null
      },
      "note": "Off again, it holds nothing and is no longer listed among the entries that can hold any."
    },
    {
      "app": "input.move",
      "params": {
        "x": 800,
        "y": 120
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "until": "time",
        "ms": 600
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "label": "Synthetic moved entry",
        "role": "Group",
        "count": 1
      },
      "save": "assignDropFrom",
      "note": "An entry with both 「层级」 and 「收别处的条目」 on takes a plain drop in the left column as a resident: since T9 a drag there only moves house, and only ⌥ held over such an entry attaches (kernel-v5 §16 「挂名」; the v5 task book's items 52 and 60, docs/rust-rewrite/handoff/v5-tracks.md at 64563601b). The bridge's drag carries no modifiers."
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "label": "Synthetic member host",
        "role": "Group",
        "count": 1
      },
      "save": "assignDropTo"
    },
    {
      "app": "input.drag",
      "params": {
        "from": "${assignDropFrom.nodes.0.center}",
        "to": "${assignDropTo.nodes.0.center}",
        "steps": 12
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "until": "time",
        "ms": 4000
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait"
    },
    {
      "app": "state.get",
      "expect": {
        "/v3/levels/${host.id}/children": [
          "${moved.id}"
        ],
        "/v3/levels/${host.id}/members": []
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.get",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "id": "${moved.id}"
      },
      "expect": {
        "/parent": "${host.id}"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "nav.open",
      "params": {
        "target": "entry:${host.id}"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait"
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "role": "CheckBox",
        "label": "Accept entries from elsewhere"
      },
      "note": "The host's page has the 「挂在这里的条目」 block; its head is the 「收别处的条目」 switch (T1)."
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.screenshot",
      "png": "01-tree-membership.png"
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "label": "${roots.3.title}",
        "role": "RadioButton"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "state": {
          "/v3Sidebar/entry": "${roots.3.id}"
        },
        "timeout_ms": 15000
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "window.focus"
    },
    {
      "app": "input.move",
      "params": {
        "x": 800,
        "y": 120
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "until": "time",
        "ms": 600
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.update",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "id": "${entries.[template=tpl-storyline].id}",
        "overrides": {
          "home": "${a.id}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "until": "time",
        "ms": 4000
      },
      "note": "The wait the scenarios give a write to reach the window: ui.wait reads its state pointers as written, and a reference in an object key is not filled in (scenario.rs fills strings and expectation pointers), so this pointer, which names an entry by reference, is checked by state.get's expect below."
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait"
    },
    {
      "app": "state.get",
      "expect": {
        "/v3/levels/${entries.[template=tpl-storyline].id}/settings/home": "${a.id}"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.hover",
      "params": {
        "label": "${entries.[template=tpl-storyline].title}",
        "role": "Group"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.find",
      "params": {
        "label": "New",
        "role": "MenuItem",
        "timeout_ms": 6000
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "label": "New",
        "role": "MenuItem"
      },
      "note": "On a storyline (「层级」 off, 「收别处的条目」 on) the hover card's 「新建」 attaches the new entry, which lives where 「新条目住在」 says (kernel-v5 §16)."
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "state": {
          "/pageTitle": "Untitled",
          "/dialog": false,
          "/v3Page/head": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.screenshot",
      "png": "02-selected-title.png"
    },
    {
      "app": "input.type",
      "params": {
        "text": "Synthetic card creation"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "input.key",
      "params": {
        "keys": "enter"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "state": {
          "/pageTitle": "Synthetic card creation"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "call": "entry.list",
      "input": {
        "book": "${books.0.id}",
        "all": true,
        "query": "Synthetic card creation"
      },
      "save": "created",
      "expect": {
        "/0/parent": "${a.id}",
        "/0/template": "tpl-chapter",
        "/0/primary": "${entries.[template=tpl-storyline].id}"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "until": "time",
        "ms": 4000
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait"
    },
    {
      "app": "state.get",
      "expect": {
        "/page": "entry:${created.0.id}",
        "/v3/levels/${a.id}/children": [
          "${nested.id}",
          "${created.0.id}"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.press",
      "params": {
        "label": "${roots.0.title}",
        "role": "RadioButton"
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "state": {
          "/v3Sidebar/entry": "${roots.0.id}"
        },
        "timeout_ms": 15000
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "window.focus"
    },
    {
      "app": "input.move",
      "params": {
        "x": 800,
        "y": 120
      }
    },
    {
      "app": "ui.wait",
      "params": {
        "until": "time",
        "ms": 600
      }
    },
